WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.630 --> 00:00:04.489
The first reactions to James Gunn's The Suicide
Squad are finally live.

00:00:04.489 --> 00:00:08.940
Though the film is officially set to premiere
on August 6 on both HBO Max and in theaters,

00:00:08.940 --> 00:00:12.170
several critics have had the privilege of
seeing it early - and their reactions are

00:00:12.170 --> 00:00:14.187
getting fans even more excited.

00:00:14.187 --> 00:00:18.039
The movie follows a team of supervillains
who are recruited to join the mysterious Task

00:00:18.039 --> 00:00:22.320
Force X for a super-dangerous mission to defeat
monsters and enemies on the fictional island

00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:23.610
of Corto Maltese.

00:00:23.610 --> 00:00:27.679
Fans of the original Suicide Squad will enjoy
seeing some of their favorite characters return

00:00:27.679 --> 00:00:32.388
for the newest iteration, including Harley
Quinn, Rick Flag, Captain Boomerang, and Amanda Waller.

00:00:32.457 --> 00:00:36.640
This rendition will also feature several new
characters, such as Bloodsport, Peacemaker,

00:00:36.640 --> 00:00:38.067
Blackguard, and King Shark.

00:00:38.067 --> 00:00:40.410
"I'm not joining your Suicide Squad."

00:00:41.024 --> 00:00:41.901
"We'll see."

00:00:41.901 --> 00:00:45.870
Excitement for The Suicide Squad has only
grown with every new trailer drop and leaked

00:00:45.870 --> 00:00:47.034
photo from the set.

00:00:47.034 --> 00:00:50.990
As the premiere date quickly approaches, fans
are eager for updates on the upcoming film

00:00:50.990 --> 00:00:53.930
— and the first reviews are sure to get
audiences pumped.

00:00:53.930 --> 00:00:57.980
Though the original Suicide Squad received
lackluster reviews, it looks like the James

00:00:57.980 --> 00:01:00.800
Gunn-led version is everything critics could've
hoped for.

00:01:00.800 --> 00:01:03.000
Steven Weintraub of Collider tweeted,

00:01:03.000 --> 00:01:04.995
"Absolutely loved #thesuicidesquad.

00:01:04.995 --> 00:01:09.579
The movie is super violent, extremely funny,
and a huge home [run] for @JamesGunn and #DC.

00:01:09.579 --> 00:01:12.009
Tons of surprises and things I wasn't expecting.

00:01:12.009 --> 00:01:13.060
Just a great movie."

00:01:13.060 --> 00:01:17.409
Umberto Gonzalez of The Wrap also had positive
things to say about the film, tweeting,

00:01:17.409 --> 00:01:19.637
"#TheSuicideSquad is absolutely BUCK WILD!

00:01:19.637 --> 00:01:21.149
I enjoyed the hell out of it.

00:01:21.149 --> 00:01:24.595
James Gunn has easily made DC's most enjoyable
movie to date.

00:01:24.595 --> 00:01:27.433
Visually stunning, action packed and full
of swagger."

00:01:27.433 --> 00:01:31.850
One of the criticisms of 2016's Suicide Squad
was that fans felt it could've gone further

00:01:31.850 --> 00:01:34.520
with the action, violence, and overall villainous
content.

00:01:34.520 --> 00:01:37.893
Kirsten Acuna of Insider praised Gunn's direction
with a tweet that said,

00:01:37.893 --> 00:01:41.659
"#TheSuicideSquad is probably the wildest,
wackiest, bloodiest comic book movie I've

00:01:41.659 --> 00:01:42.462
ever seen.

00:01:42.462 --> 00:01:45.549
Very clear they let James Gunn run wild and
not hold back.

00:01:45.549 --> 00:01:48.499
Definitely gives Harley one of her best scenes
period."

00:01:48.499 --> 00:01:51.083
The Suicide Squad has its fair share of doubters.

00:01:51.083 --> 00:01:55.324
Nonetheless, even admitted skeptics conceded
that the film surpassed their expectations.

00:01:55.324 --> 00:01:57.039
Kara Warner of People tweeted,

00:01:57.039 --> 00:01:59.590
"So this skeptic loved #TheSuicideSquad.

00:01:59.590 --> 00:02:03.408
It is balls to the wall *bonkers* in very
entertaining ways. i.e.

00:02:03.408 --> 00:02:05.890
If you're wondering whether James Gunn and
that super rad @SuicideSquadWB cast would

00:02:05.890 --> 00:02:09.570
truly go there w/ the material &amp; the R-rating,
indeed they DO."

00:02:09.570 --> 00:02:13.550
Ian Sandwell of Digital Spy also tweeted a
message to naysayers, writing,

00:02:13.550 --> 00:02:17.746
"Any doubts you might have over #TheSuicideSquad
will vanish after the outrageous opening.

00:02:17.746 --> 00:02:21.570
It's a violent, hilarious and unpredictable
blockbuster, and everyone will have their

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:23.480
own favourite from the terrific cast.

00:02:23.480 --> 00:02:26.540
It's just so entertaining that you'll want
to see [it] again instantly."

00:02:26.540 --> 00:02:29.631
Film critic Drew Taylor echoed Sandwell's
comment, writing,

00:02:29.631 --> 00:02:33.410
"@JamesGunn's #TheSuicideSquad is gloriously
insane and so, so fun.

00:02:33.410 --> 00:02:35.814
(After watching it, you'll think you might
have dreamed it.)

00:02:35.814 --> 00:02:39.380
Everyone is excellent and deeply committed
to the material and its singular mood and

00:02:39.380 --> 00:02:40.639
wild ass aesthetic.

00:02:40.639 --> 00:02:43.050
Can't wait to ride this rollercoaster again."

00:02:43.050 --> 00:02:46.820
The Suicide Squad is getting an overwhelming
amount of praise for its violent material,

00:02:46.820 --> 00:02:49.870
along with its humor, heart, and stunning
visual effects.

00:02:49.870 --> 00:02:54.234
Critic Brandon Davis's enthusiasm for The
Suicide Squad was obvious from his tweet:

00:02:54.234 --> 00:02:56.730
"#TheSuicideSquad is absolutely insane.

00:02:56.730 --> 00:02:58.570
Violent as hell, raunchy, unforgiving.

00:02:58.570 --> 00:03:00.630
James Gunn is fully unleashed.

00:03:00.630 --> 00:03:01.870
It's sometimes overwhelming.

00:03:01.870 --> 00:03:05.033
It has moments of heart, humor, action, emotion...
all of it.

00:03:05.033 --> 00:03:05.617
Relentless.

00:03:05.726 --> 00:03:06.866
There's nothing like it.

00:03:07.019 --> 00:03:07.932
Damn!"

00:03:07.932 --> 00:03:12.868
Erik Davis of Rotten Tomatoes also noted the
stunning visuals of The Suicide Squad, tweeting that he

00:03:12.868 --> 00:03:16.750
"had the BEST time watching #TheSuicideSquad
— it is a swing-for-the-fences kind of comic

00:03:16.750 --> 00:03:18.250
book movie &amp; I love that.

00:03:18.250 --> 00:03:19.987
It's big, bold &amp; visually stunning.

00:03:19.987 --> 00:03:22.880
You will see James Gunn's horror roots splattered
all over this thing.

00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:24.320
It's violent, but hilarious.

00:03:24.320 --> 00:03:26.570
Angry, but also VERY sweet."

00:03:26.570 --> 00:03:31.130
The Suicide Squad hits HBO Max and theaters
on August 6, so prepare yourself for some

00:03:31.130 --> 00:03:36.064
epic butt-kicking, killer cinematography,
and James Gunn's signature sense of humor and style.

